### =====================================================================
### SAEP 2026 - Simulado Barbearia - testes com REST Client
### 1) Rode o login, copie o token da resposta e cole na variável abaixo
### =====================================================================

@token = COLE_O_TOKEN_AQUI

### Login com sucesso
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "marcos@barbearia.com",
    "senha": "123"
}


### Login com falha (senha errada) -> 401
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "marcos@barbearia.com",
    "senha": "errada"
}


### Sem token -> 401
GET http://localhost:3000/barbeiros


### Listar barbeiros
GET http://localhost:3000/barbeiros
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Buscar barbeiros por termo
GET http://localhost:3000/barbeiros?busca=raf
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Cadastrar barbeiro (CPF e senha vão criptografados)
POST http://localhost:3000/barbeiros
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Thiago Pente",
    "email": "thiago@barbearia.com",
    "cpf": "444.555.666-77",
    "senha": "123",
    "telefone": "48999994444"
}


### Editar barbeiro
PUT http://localhost:3000/barbeiros/4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Thiago Pente Jr",
    "email": "thiago@barbearia.com",
    "telefone": "48999995555"
}


### Excluir barbeiro
DELETE http://localhost:3000/barbeiros/4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Listar clientes
GET http://localhost:3000/clientes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Cadastrar cliente associado a um barbeiro
POST http://localhost:3000/clientes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Pedro Henrique",
    "telefone": "48988884444",
    "estilo_corte": "Low fade",
    "barbeiro_id": 1
}


### Listar agendamentos (ordenado por data, com barbeiro e cliente)
GET http://localhost:3000/agendamentos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Cadastrar agendamento
POST http://localhost:3000/agendamentos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "data_agendamento": "2026-11-21T15:00:00",
    "servico": "Barba",
    "barbeiro_id": 1,
    "cliente_id": 1
}


### Atualizar a data de um agendamento
PUT http://localhost:3000/agendamentos/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "data_agendamento": "2026-11-17T08:30:00"
}
